  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of the diameter of the circle is given as<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ...(i)</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;are the given points, then&nbsp;<br /><br />slope of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>PN</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Equation of normal through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PN</mi></math> is<br /><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0000_d77221c42576.jpg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 206px;\" /><br /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ...(ii)<br /><br />solving (i) and (ii), we get, the centre as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />Hence, the equation of the circle is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
  }
